Import the C function thrd_create taking a pointer to unsigned long integer and a pointer to function taking pointer to void returning integer and a pointer to void, returning an integer, from the header "threads.h".
Import the C function thrd_join taking an unsigned long integer and a pointer to integer, returning an integer, from the header "threads.h".
Declare payload as integer with value 0.
Declare ready as atomic integer with value 0.
Procedure producer takes arg as pointer to void returns integer:
    Set payload to 42.
    Atomic store 1 to ready with release order.
    Return 0.
End procedure.
Declare worker as unsigned long integer.
Declare status as integer.
Set status to Call thrd_create with Address of worker, Address of producer, null pointer done.
While Atomic load of ready with acquire order is equal to 0:
    Set status to 0.
End while.
Say payload.
Set status to Call thrd_join with worker, null pointer done.
